nity hub and reading your feedback.Read of Mask transports you to a bleak but captivating vision of 1999 Eastern Europe. This isn't just a traditional puzzle game; it is an exploration of space, logic, and perception. Watch the gameplay to see how we navigate complex, realit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:23:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690502","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4731160-1836506165581662","game_id":"steam-4731160","kind":"announcement","title":"Read of Mask Demo is Live!","summary":"Hello everyone!We are incredibly excited to announce that the first official demo for Read of Mask is now live and ready for you to play!Whether you have been following our progress or are just discovering our surreal black-and-white world for the first time, we invite you to step in and look through the mask.What to Expect in the DemoThis demo is a curated slice of the game designed to introduce you to our universe. In this build, you will be able to:Explore core mechanics in headmistress cabin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T20:53:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165581662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4731160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4731160":"2026-10-26T14:04:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4731160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:42Z"},"4912920":{"last_attempt_at":